  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row64Member">㈱ＴＳＩホールディングス</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
